# 2026-02-13 17:01:45.598445
+Here is a lean, high-signal prompt optimized for Aider multi-file diff mode (designed to minimize tokens and get straight to code edits).
+
+You can paste this directly into Aider:
+
+AIDER MULTI-FILE FIX PROMPT
+
+You are modifying an existing React + Vite + Node/Express + SQLite photo gallery project.
+
+Problem
+
+Frontend is running on:
+
+http://127.0.0.1:5173
+
+
+Backend is running on:
+
+http://127.0.0.1:3001
+
+
+Backend API works when tested directly:
+
+curl http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/search?q=jpg
+
+
+But frontend calls like:
+
+await fetch(`/api/search?q=${query}`)
+
+
+Are failing or returning 404 for:
+
+/api/people
+/api/people/unidentified
+
+
+Direct backend thumbnail tests work:
+
+curl -I http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/photos/115730/thumbnail
+
+
+And proxy access also returns 200:
+
+curl -I http://127.0.0.1:5173/api/photos/115730/thumbnail
+
+
+Search works in browser console:
+
+await fetch("/api/search?q=jpg").then(r => r.json())
+
+
+So:
+
+Backend is healthy
+
+Vite proxy partially works
+
+Some API routes return 404
+
+Likely missing backend routes or mismatch between frontend expectations and backend implementation
+
+Objectives
+
+Ensure all /api/* calls from frontend resolve correctly.
+
+Add missing Express routes if required:
+
+/api/people
+
+/api/people/unidentified
+
+Ensure Vite proxy is correctly configured.
+
+Keep changes minimal and consistent with project style.
+
+Do NOT rewrite architecture.
+
+Do NOT refactor unrelated files.
+
+Required Actions
+
+Search entire repo for:
+
+/api/search
+
+/api/people
+
+/api/photos
+
+server.js
+
+vite.config
+
+any router files
+
+Then:
+
+Fix missing backend routes if they do not exist.
+
+Ensure Vite proxy is defined as:
+
+server: {
+  proxy: {
+    "/api": "http://127.0.0.1:3001"
+  }
+}
+
+
+Ensure backend mounts routes under /api.
+
+Ensure CORS is not blocking requests.
+
+Return diff patches only.
+
+Keep responses minimal.
+
+Constraints
+
+Multi-file diff mode.
+
+Only edit necessary files.
+
+No explanations.
+
+No markdown.
+
+Output unified diffs only.
+
+If routes are intentionally unimplemented, stub them with safe JSON responses instead of leaving 404.

